{
 "batchId": "b-0071",
 "sourceSetHash": "2bb765198fa14f1818bc2d39e1c2b0b4fbcca43e35fd776b7cdd9a4bea65a84f",
 "locale": "zh-Hans",
 "units": [
  {
   "id": "t_61b8ff6794e196787d40",
   "sourceHash": "61b8ff6794e196787d4030534f9377fa1337fe534138ab98b6620273dace4c90",
   "text": "Kairali – The Ayurvedic Healing Village 已获得 NABH 认证，其运营标准通过 ISO 认证，并因其阿育吠陀实践和环保举措获得喀拉拉邦旅游局颁发的 Green Leaf 认证。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_17c2a013a4b508e6497c",
   "sourceHash": "17c2a013a4b508e6497cb02f8ddc0dbad5327923cc6d5e459e498f1f2be1cb29",
   "text": "完整列表请见我们的[[OPEN_1]]认证页面[[CLOSE_1]]。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_310769f259b39d259c4f",
   "sourceHash": "310769f259b39d259c4f339eae71552e90bbb979de3e088f274e842d9755d59e",
   "text": "Kairali 的阿育吠陀治疗理念是什么？",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_8f971d999fbf3134551a",
   "sourceHash": "8f971d999fbf3134551a7e349e70d31224c7da4e66a6c3594a5af0cdae913a83",
   "text": "Kairali 的每个方案都从医生对您体质的评估开始，随后为您制定包含疗法、饮食和日常练习的个性化计划。医院全部阿育吠陀方案的治疗均由具备 BAMS 资质的医生负责。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_62737585880757b3da8f",
   "sourceHash": "62737585880757b3da8f16d1d5477c9e389b8f623f82e7d31a30e07ff0b2ee14",
   "text": "请查看[[OPEN_1]]阿育吠陀治疗方案[[CLOSE_1]]。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_6b21d7f3d4ca41b3032a",
   "sourceHash": "6b21d7f3d4ca41b3032a8ecc4cc4fc2c4c300610168c5285f165a8b06a63765e",
   "text": "在 Kairali 住院期间包含哪些内容？",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_cbf19a0997783ff3d8de",
   "sourceHash": "cbf19a0997783ff3d8ded7c4370863299ec3939d3f041f745182c9cd8e71b1aa",
   "text": "住院期间包括别墅住宿、医嘱规定的每日疗法、与我们医生的复诊问诊，以及有机素食餐，全部在同一个住院式院区内完成。患者在同一院区内住宿、接受治疗和用餐，无需往返于不同设施之间。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_e3dcbd91e0530d7dd136",
   "sourceHash": "e3dcbd91e0530d7dd1360acdfdbf61d1f728091e717accdf3d12e0b4757f44cb",
   "text": "查看各[[OPEN_1]]别墅房型[[CLOSE_1]]包含的内容。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_e13b3b7545ec2bb86f6a",
   "sourceHash": "e13b3b7545ec2bb86f6acd1c044fca42d9903e2d8f0d36a9e57c8ff4d0625bd0",
   "text": "我可以在 Kairali 选择更短或更长的方案吗？",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_3f40467f4eb922406a62",
   "sourceHash": "3f40467f4eb922406a6201908ead33789ae12180a19f45670b76cf9f489e24df",
   "text": "可以。Kairali 的方案时长从 3 晚的预防保健住院到针对慢性病的 21 晚方案不等，您的医生可根据您的健康目标推荐合适的时长。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_99415ffea5e36bff046e",
   "sourceHash": "99415ffea5e36bff046e13941d372b39f766419e7ab251618fbadecb8983e62c",
   "text": "在我们的[[OPEN_1]]方案页面[[CLOSE_1]]浏览全部选择。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_a044b7030065781eae27",
   "sourceHash": "a044b7030065781eae272e859f4687d1807bd1894bb89045cb4fc5b333db7c07",
   "text": "Kairali 的治疗计划由谁主导？",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_d52836df04131413e160",
   "sourceHash": "d52836df04131413e160d787ac228a572dcf1d4dd32dbdabf6bb8447397cd835",
   "text": "治疗计划由具备 BAMS 资质的阿育吠陀医生主导，他们会在问诊时评估您的病情，并在您住院期间持续跟进进展。首席医师兼科室主任负责监督所有方案的医疗工作。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_f6b809dd0ea37aaea903",
   "sourceHash": "f6b809dd0ea37aaea9035959e89bc4410a1c7cb79f695170a5fee15c6d3e8dbe",
   "text": "如需咨询入院事宜，请联系[[OPEN_1]]患者服务团队[[CLOSE_1]]。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Provided term 'Admission' = 入学 (school enrolment) is wrong for a hospital; used 入院 (hospital admission). Please review the term list."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_c7cbcca180cdb705c04e",
   "sourceHash": "c7cbcca180cdb705c04e86f65b1ac78e6b38ce7f1ec4f029c079ce3b129192c8",
   "text": "Kairali 在阿育吠陀领域有着怎样的历史？",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_2bac300cb9b0ce71ffad",
   "sourceHash": "2bac300cb9b0ce71ffad7592d4a891e7c771fdef142939cbd5c915e4428a351c",
   "text": "Kairali 是一家家族经营的阿育吠陀机构，其董事总经理 K.V. Ramesh 代表着家族四代人对阿育吠陀实践的坚守。位于喀拉拉邦巴拉卡德（Palakkad, Kerala）的 Kairali – The Ayurvedic Healing Village 是集团的住院式医院院区。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_52f65c5ff4db0563b5cf",
   "sourceHash": "52f65c5ff4db0563b5cfecf36aceefb72e6ba87af828b72a20624aa14963f7e8",
   "text": "更多信息请见我们的[[OPEN_1]]关于我们页面[[CLOSE_1]]。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_e3676666d63a894eaa0e",
   "sourceHash": "e3676666d63a894eaa0e908912cd92aab418fff0a9f1ce3775c2375e3d24a099",
   "text": "问诊与入院",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Provided term 'Admission' = 入学 (school enrolment) is wrong for a hospital; used 入院 (hospital admission). Please review the term list."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_849fc07b3ff014d605b6",
   "sourceHash": "849fc07b3ff014d605b611d2881a6adc255b686347bcb2ff2a5c276c9fcf2fde",
   "text": "3 个问题",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_b7ee8984af2a83499d2c",
   "sourceHash": "b7ee8984af2a83499d2c4d8c90555b08122157586af75e1fc33d9115ecc90642",
   "text": "新患者可以进行在线问诊吗？",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_b0a2d115dbb737f215f9",
   "sourceHash": "b0a2d115dbb737f215f9dff87f5ba18f16b1f31a2e909a89e09a18a1bc69fc04",
   "text": "接受治疗是否有最低或最高年龄限制？",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_6f85b7906bc0cab0755f",
   "sourceHash": "6f85b7906bc0cab0755fc1fceb071fcde4a763f65c1eb080a838ee3269871468",
   "text": "预订须由年满 18 岁的患者办理；未成年人在父母或法定监护人陪同下欢迎前来。目前没有规定最高年龄。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_de0f2d5e6ab4c0703c1c",
   "sourceHash": "de0f2d5e6ab4c0703c1ce26691457ea4c9d2aca188ac116fcf1abe3e0f70bd6e",
   "text": "5 岁以下儿童免费入住，5–12 岁儿童的餐饮和加床按 50% 收费，12 岁以上按全价收费。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_a433c22230d6ae0e08ff",
   "sourceHash": "a433c22230d6ae0e08ff2ebaacdfad5f59b3295c7c5d8bfb596a2f0d64948041",
   "text": "儿童可以接受治疗或陪同父母前来吗？",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_687b51ca099920479b36",
   "sourceHash": "687b51ca099920479b36a92c8dec3a8b4de83d758e44dfc84ff752a1e5798eec",
   "text": "欢迎儿童陪同父母或法定监护人前来（5 岁以下儿童免费入住；5–12 岁儿童的餐饮和加床按 50% 收费）。院区部分区域主要为治疗而设计，可能不适合儿童。儿童能否接受阿育吠陀治疗取决于年龄和病情——请在预订前向我们的医生确认。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  }
 ]
}
